{"duration_api_ms":6772,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"1b8d021d-b2d6-437e-8f89-a1e68cc2bf14","total_cost_usd":0.017105099999999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":653,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":587,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":190},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":653,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":653,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":653},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1221,"outputTokens":22,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0001331,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":587,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":653,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.016971999999999998,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":190,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":653,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Short answer: they reduce NAV but are excluded from the expense ratio.**\n\n- **Brokerage commissions** are capitalized into the cost basis of securities bought and deducted from sale proceeds. They show up as lower realized or unrealized gains, not as fund expenses. Under SEC Form N-1A they are disclosed separately: dollar commissions in the SAI, and portfolio turnover in the prospectus, which warns that turnover costs aren't in the fee table.\n- **Bid-ask spreads and market impact** are implicit costs built into execution prices. They are never itemized anywhere and simply lower NAV.\n- **Net effect:** These costs appear as tracking difference beyond the expense ratio, so the \"true\" cost exceeds the reported expense ratio.\n- **ETF mitigants:**\n  - In-kind creations and redemptions shift most rebalancing trading to authorized participants.\n  - Creation/redemption transaction fees, or cash-in-lieu charges, offset the trading costs from flows, protecting existing shareholders.\n  - Low-turnover index funds incur minimal costs. Higher-turnover or active ETFs, especially cash-creation ones, bear more.","ttft_ms":2556,"type":"result","duration_ms":6255,"uuid":"6ca5b512-a648-49e6-a683-c82f5b0c55e6","ttft_stream_ms":591,"time_to_request_ms":71,"first_content_frame_ms":591,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
